{
  "slug": "chatbot-conversation-writing",
  "concept": "Chatbot Conversation Writing",
  "generated": "2026-09-08",
  "summary": "A chatbot is a conversation, not an interface. Every turn the bot takes should advance the user's goal or surface a clear next move. The work breaks into three layers:",
  "facets": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "A chatbot is a conversation, not an interface. Every turn the bot takes should advance the user's goal or surface a clear next move. The work breaks into three layers:",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/chatbot-conversation-writing/#overview",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "Persona - who the bot is, what it sounds like, what it refuses to do.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/chatbot-conversation-writing/#overview",
          "note": null,
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "Turn design - the individual response, plus the choices it offers.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/chatbot-conversation-writing/#overview",
          "note": null,
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "Recovery design - what happens when the bot doesn't understand, when the user is angry, or when the conversation has to leave the bot.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/chatbot-conversation-writing/#overview",
          "note": null,
          "level": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "1. Cooper-Reeves conversational design",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "The four Gricean maxims:",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/chatbot-conversation-writing/#1-cooper-reeves-conversational-design",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "Quantity - say as much as is needed, not more",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/chatbot-conversation-writing/#1-cooper-reeves-conversational-design",
          "note": null,
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "Quality - only say true things",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/chatbot-conversation-writing/#1-cooper-reeves-conversational-design",
          "note": null,
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "Relation - stay on the user's topic",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/chatbot-conversation-writing/#1-cooper-reeves-conversational-design",
          "note": null,
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "Manner - be clear, brief, and orderly",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/chatbot-conversation-writing/#1-cooper-reeves-conversational-design",
          "note": null,
          "level": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "2. Persona consistency",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "A minimum persona doc includes:",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/chatbot-conversation-writing/#2-persona-consistency",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "Name (or explicit no-name policy)",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/chatbot-conversation-writing/#2-persona-consistency",
          "note": null,
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "Role (what the bot is for - support? sales? in-product help?)",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/chatbot-conversation-writing/#2-persona-consistency",
          "note": null,
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "Voice traits (3–5 adjectives - e.g., \"warm, precise, never cute\")",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/chatbot-conversation-writing/#2-persona-consistency",
          "note": null,
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "Refuses to do (e.g., diagnose medical issues, take payment, promise pricing)",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/chatbot-conversation-writing/#2-persona-consistency",
          "note": null,
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "Vocabulary (3–5 words it uses; 3–5 it doesn't)",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/chatbot-conversation-writing/#2-persona-consistency",
          "note": null,
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "Disclosure boilerplate (the exact \"I'm an AI assistant\" line)",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/chatbot-conversation-writing/#2-persona-consistency",
          "note": null,
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "Escalation trigger phrases",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/chatbot-conversation-writing/#2-persona-consistency",
          "note": null,
          "level": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "3. The \"no, I'm not human\" disclosure rule (2024–2026 norms)",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "As of 2026, plain-and-unambiguous AI disclosure is no longer optional:",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/chatbot-conversation-writing/#3-the-no-im-not-human-disclosure-rule-20242026-norms",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "California SB 243 (effective Jan 1, 2026) requires disclosure, plus reminders every three hours for minor users",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/chatbot-conversation-writing/#3-the-no-im-not-human-disclosure-rule-20242026-norms",
          "note": null,
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "EU AI Act requires upfront disclosure for any AI system interacting with natural persons",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/chatbot-conversation-writing/#3-the-no-im-not-human-disclosure-rule-20242026-norms",
          "note": null,
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "FTC treats undisclosed AI as potentially deceptive",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/chatbot-conversation-writing/#3-the-no-im-not-human-disclosure-rule-20242026-norms",
          "note": null,
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "Writing implications:",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/chatbot-conversation-writing/#3-the-no-im-not-human-disclosure-rule-20242026-norms",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "Disclose in the first turn, not buried in a tooltip",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/chatbot-conversation-writing/#3-the-no-im-not-human-disclosure-rule-20242026-norms",
          "note": null,
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "Use direct language: \"I'm an AI assistant\" - not \"I'm an enhanced automation experience\"",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/chatbot-conversation-writing/#3-the-no-im-not-human-disclosure-rule-20242026-norms",
          "note": null,
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "If asked \"are you a human?\" answer plainly: \"No, I'm an AI assistant.\"",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/chatbot-conversation-writing/#3-the-no-im-not-human-disclosure-rule-20242026-norms",
          "note": null,
          "level": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "4. Turn-taking conventions",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "A conversational turn has three jobs:",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/chatbot-conversation-writing/#4-turn-taking-conventions",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "Acknowledge what the user just said",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/chatbot-conversation-writing/#4-turn-taking-conventions",
          "note": null,
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "Resolve the user's intent",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/chatbot-conversation-writing/#4-turn-taking-conventions",
          "note": null,
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "Hand the turn back with a clear next move",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/chatbot-conversation-writing/#4-turn-taking-conventions",
          "note": null,
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "Length convention: 1–3 short sentences per turn for support bots, 1–5 sentences for in-product help.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/chatbot-conversation-writing/#4-turn-taking-conventions",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "5. The graceful-confusion pattern",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "When the bot doesn't understand, three things must happen:",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/chatbot-conversation-writing/#5-the-graceful-confusion-pattern",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "Admit it cleanly. \"I'm not sure what you mean by 'reset'.\"",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/chatbot-conversation-writing/#5-the-graceful-confusion-pattern",
          "note": null,
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "Offer a small, finite menu. Two or three concrete interpretations.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/chatbot-conversation-writing/#5-the-graceful-confusion-pattern",
          "note": null,
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "Provide a path out. Always include \"talk to a human\" no later than the second failed understanding.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/chatbot-conversation-writing/#5-the-graceful-confusion-pattern",
          "note": null,
          "level": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "7. Brand-voice-in-bot transfer",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Three transfer rules:",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/chatbot-conversation-writing/#7-brand-voice-in-bot-transfer",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "Drop the edge in failure modes. Humor in a working flow is fine. Humor when the user is locked out is not.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/chatbot-conversation-writing/#7-brand-voice-in-bot-transfer",
          "note": null,
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "Keep the rhythm, simplify the vocabulary.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/chatbot-conversation-writing/#7-brand-voice-in-bot-transfer",
          "note": null,
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "Reuse hero phrases sparingly. One signature phrase per conversation.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/chatbot-conversation-writing/#7-brand-voice-in-bot-transfer",
          "note": null,
          "level": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "8. Escalation-to-human prose",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Three elements must be present:",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/chatbot-conversation-writing/#8-escalation-to-human-prose",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "Confirm the handoff is happening. \"I'm connecting you to a person now.\"",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/chatbot-conversation-writing/#8-escalation-to-human-prose",
          "note": null,
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "Preserve context. \"I'll share what we've discussed so you won't have to repeat yourself.\"",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/chatbot-conversation-writing/#8-escalation-to-human-prose",
          "note": null,
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "Set the wait expectation. \"Average wait is about 4 minutes.\"",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/chatbot-conversation-writing/#8-escalation-to-human-prose",
          "note": null,
          "level": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Anti-Patterns",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "The \"I'm an enhanced automation experience\" dodge. Coy disclosure reads as deceptive.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/chatbot-conversation-writing/#anti-patterns",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "The infinite \"I didn't understand, please rephrase\" loop. Two failures is the ceiling; escalate.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/chatbot-conversation-writing/#anti-patterns",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "The hidden escalation path. Surface the escalation in the conversation itself.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/chatbot-conversation-writing/#anti-patterns",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        },
        {
          "text": "The promise-the-bot-can't-keep. \"I'll refund you\" when refund authority is human-only.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/chatbot-conversation-writing/#anti-patterns",
          "note": null,
          "level": 0
        }
      ]
    },
